font="3" color="221B16" style="2" fill="0" direction="3" border_style="2">V1 models an external, regulated 12 V DC adapter. R1 and C1 filter the shared rail, C2 bypasses higher frequencies, and R2 bleeds the reservoir. No mains circuitry is included.</NOTE_TEXT></TinyCAD><DSNSETTINGS><SHOW_RULERS>1</SHOW_RULERS></DSNSETTINGS><NETLIST_TYPES><TYPE name="default"/></NETLIST_TYPES></TinyCADSheets>